            "title": "DEVELOP YOUR COACHING MUSCLE (Critical)",
            "description": "Current usage: 26% | Optimal: 35-40%. Recommended: \"Good to Great\" by Jim Collins - See how elite leaders develop people AND drive relentless results simultaneously. Practice: Spend 30 min weekly in development conversations. Why: Your team needs growth opportunities, not just targets."
          },
