            "title": "IMPROVE DEMOCRATIC DECISION-MAKING (Opportunity)",
            "description": "You made most major decisions unilaterally. Recommended: Implement peer problem-solving techniques. Resource: \"Death by Meeting\" by Patrick Lencioni - Turn endless consultation into decisive, well-structured decisions."
